1
00:00:00,850 --> 00:00:03,550
Every line must meet its end.

2
00:00:04,770 --> 00:00:07,370
Behold the perfect blank canvas.

3
00:00:10,590 --> 00:00:12,310
I must unlock the final portal.

4
00:00:13,330 --> 00:00:15,390
The Grand Convergence is here.

5
00:00:32,470 --> 00:00:34,190
Follow the light across the dark.

6
00:00:34,970 --> 00:00:36,470
I will draw the sparks away.

7
00:00:37,570 --> 00:00:38,930
The path is clear now.

8
00:00:48,670 --> 00:00:50,570
I will protect the Living Spectrum.

9
00:00:51,310 --> 00:00:53,350
Our colors will never fade.

10
00:01:12,990 --> 00:01:16,870
We are all just... terrified of being forgotten,

11
00:01:16,950 --> 00:01:19,170
hoping not to be crumpled away.

12
00:01:20,650 --> 00:01:25,090
With every line we create,
this world is ours to complete.

13
00:01:35,440 --> 00:01:36,610
From unfinished lines,

14
00:01:37,940 --> 00:01:42,940
I awaken as a completed masterpiece,
bathed in light and color.

15
00:02:00,130 --> 00:02:06,130
Every unfinished line finds its true meaning
when different worlds create together.
